WEBVTT

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:09.860
Today, I'll buy <i>yakisoba</i> bread...

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.490
...for sure!

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.240
Wha...?!

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:16.620
Ahhhh!

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:17.790
Levi!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.710
I'll repay you for the bread
the day before yesterday!

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.290
Shut up, you damn four-eyes!

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.040
My <i>yakisoba</i> bread...!

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.170
So... I couldn't buy my long-desired
<i>yakisoba</i> bread again today.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.720
Don't you know that there's a tacit rule

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:36.720
that Year 1 students aren't supposed
to buy bread at the school shop?

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:39.390
Just how much do our
upperclassmen love bread?!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.850
That's not it. They're just doing it
to rub their seniority in our faces.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.230
I-I didn't know that!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:45.770
- More importantly...
- Hm?

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.030
...you've been skipping the
Wall Cleanup Club activities lately.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:53.530
Rico was very upset.
Make sure you show up today.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.220
Period 7
Showdown! Titan Junior High School

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.130
Rico!

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:34.800
Hello.

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:35.840
Hi.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:36.800
Hm?

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.260
Long time no see, huh, Jean?

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:39.140
Ugh!

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:42.220
Care to explain why you've been
skipping the club activities?

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:45.430
Well, I've been busy with
abacus school, dance school,

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.190
and online karate lessons.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.060
I know you aren't doing any of those.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:52.320
You skipped the sacred Wall Cleanup Club
activities without permission

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.690
and tell me such an obvious lie?

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.400
I'm absolutely not gonna forgive that!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:59.530
You all bear collective responsibility!
Get back your enthusiasm

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:02.030
and go clean all the windows in school!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.160
Whaaaaaat?!

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.710
I'm exhausted.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.170
I'm starving.

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:11.170
I'm sorry we're late!

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:12.540
You're late!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.380
When you come into the club room,
first say a greeting!

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.050
G-Good afternoon!

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.550
I can't hear you!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.380
Good afternoon!

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.720
Aren't you guys slacking off these days?!

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:26.520
Yes, you are! You must be slacking off!
I won't be deceived!

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.480
I-I'm sorry.

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:31.900
To start with, what's up
with those untidy clothes?!

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:34.020
A guy should wear his uniform year around

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:36.280
and make sure to button the collar!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:39.650
A Year 1 student shouldn't hang
keychains on their bag!

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.450
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:42.950
Trying to appeal to the opposite sex, huh?!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.330
Year 1 shouldn't wear colored T-shirts!

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:45.790
Wha...?!

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.540
Your skirt should go below the knees!

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:51.330
Year 1 students aren't allowed to
wear socks with a cute needlepoint design!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.630
Whaaaaat?!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.630
Your hairstyles aren't good, either!
Guys should have a close-cropped head!

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.260
It should be 3 mm in length for Year 1!

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.760
- Noooo!
- My hair is exactly 3-mm long.

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:00.880
Zip up your tracksuit all the way
until you can't any further!

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:04.050
Year 1 shouldn't tie their hair above their ears!

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.510
If you come wearing designer shoes,
you'll have to answer to us!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:09.430
I can do it! Do you wanna try and see?

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.270
Please shut up for a second!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:12.980
Wh...

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.610
...at?!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:18.780
Hello!

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:19.740
Hm?

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:22.410
I'm sorry we're late!

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.200
You bastards...!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.000
Geez... we're stuck with cleaning duty
as a penalty here, too?

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:36.250
I wonder if we're gonna be stuck with
cleaning duty for the rest of our lives.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:40.380
I don't think so, since there are
only three years in junior high.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:41.680
Ahhh!

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.300
Watch out!

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.550
Are you okay?

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:46.930
Thanks, Ymir!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:50.060
Marry me once we've finished cleaning.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:51.390
Hey, how's it going?

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.440
Hange! Levi!

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:57.480
For some reason, I feel like
I saw the same scenery last year.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.240
Hey. When'd you start cleaning here?

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:03.660
Let's see... I think it was
about ten minutes ago.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.280
Tsk.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:11.500
The three of us can make this place
twice as clean in two minutes.

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:15.290
How do you expect to fulfill your duty
as Scouts when you can't even do this?

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.000
L-Levi, we've been working earnest—

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:21.050
You keep talking about cleaning.
What are you guys, sisters-in-law?!

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:25.220
Th-That's right! "Man shall not
live on bread alone."

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:27.010
Let Year 1 buy bread at the school shop!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.720
Let's make all the guys' hair 3-mm long!

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.560
H-Hey, you guys!

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.140
Whoa!

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:39.690
What you guys need is to be
taught a lesson, not given a talking-to.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.900
Then, let's compete.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.740
And, you guys, too. You can set
a good example for Year 1

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.360
if you prove your abilities, right?

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:48.830
What?! We're doing it, too?!

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.830
Damn it! We got dragged into this!

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:54.660
In return, the grade that loses
will clean the Titans' building.

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:57.170
We'll compete the day after tomorrow...

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.550
...against the other grades
in the Sports Day games.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.260
This year's Attack Junior High's
Sports Day has begun!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.470
"Attack Junior High Sports Day"

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.090
"Attack Junior High Sports Day"
"Year 3"   "Year 2"   "Year 1"

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:07.260
This year's Attack Junior High's
Sports Day has begun!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:11.560
I, Ilse Langnar of the Newspaper Club,
will be reporting live!

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:15.230
I don't get it... How did this happen?!

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:16.940
Guys...!

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:19.980
I'm sorry. It took time for me to change!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:22.610
Sh-She's cute!

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.610
<b>Cute</b>

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:27.160
Hey, Christa...

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.570
- Hm?
- I think I wanna go change.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:33.290
What're you saying? Don't be shy. Go on!

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.420
Th-These clothes really are too small for me.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:45.760
Well then, guys! Do your best to win!

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:49.510
Guys! We'll give it everything we've got!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.180
Yeah!

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:53.220
Let's do our best!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.890
Y-Yeah.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.430
Yaay!

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:00.440
The participants for our first game,
the bun-eating race,

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.770
should now head to the entrance gate.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.980
It's already my turn!

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:06.440
Good luck, Sasha!

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.360
Leave it to me!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:09.990
Ah...

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.460
Red bean paste bun,
<i>yakisoba</i> bread, and melon bread...

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:22.170
Oh, how I've longed for them all!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.800
Hi, Sasha!

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.380
Let's do our best.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.670
I'm gonna win for sure!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.590
Well then, let's begin!

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:33.220
Ready...

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:34.850
Set...

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.520
Go, Sasha!

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:41.310
Huh?

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:44.650
Did Hange... possibly give up?

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:48.070
This round... goes to me!

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.570
Hey! Isn't that against the rules?!

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.620
We're like two halves of the same person!

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.580
That was close, Sawney!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.000
Hange! You're gonna be eaten someday!

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.550
I wanted to eat <i>yakisoba</i> bread.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:06.590
Sasha!

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.170
Hang in there!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.220
H-Hang in there!

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:15.100
Next, it's Year 1 vs. Year 2
in the ball-tossing game!

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:17.100
Both teams, ready...

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.730
Set...

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.860
I'm doing pretty good on my end.

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:29.030
Now, if Ian and the others get points...

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.120
You're playing dirty! Come down!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:37.330
If you don't like it, come up here!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:50.170
The Wall Cleanup Club's precious
omni-directional mobility gear...

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:52.840
Now is our chance!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:56.050
Don't use it without permission!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.680
Ahhhh!

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.480
Ow, ow...

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:06.110
Hm?

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:10.400
Oh, guys... good morning!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:12.570
Do it.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.700
Ahhhh! Ow!

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:16.570
O-Our upperclassmen are scary.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.870
He is totally useless.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:22.330
If we put our balls in the basket right now,
we might get killed.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.750
Hang in there!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.710
H-Hang in there...

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.800
"Year 3"   "Year 2"   "Year 1"

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:34.220
Year 1's got... f-five points...

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:37.720
They're overwhelmingly strong.
I feel like we don't have any chance at all.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:41.060
It's pretty much a done deal
that we'll be cleaning the Titans' building.

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:43.270
Maybe we should apologize to them and...

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.100
Calm down.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:46.190
Mikasa...!

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:48.940
Now isn't the time to lose heart.

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:52.360
Marco. If we take their
leaders' bandanas in shoulder wars,

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:55.910
we can turn the tables by gaining
1,000 points and win. Correct?

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:59.740
Yeah, that's right,
but there's no way that we can do—

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:00.660
I can!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.620
What?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:05.250
I'm strong.

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:07.000
I'm very strong.

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:11.050
As such, I <i>am</i> capable of
annihilating the upperclassmen there!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:13.800
Even if I have to go it alone.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:17.430
As for all of you, you're not only unskilled,

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.800
you're also cowards and wimps.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.640
You're a real disappointment.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:24.140
You can just stay here
and twiddle your thumbs.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.060
Twiddle and watch.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.940
Your way with words
is the real disappointment.

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:33.230
Hey! Since when were we taught
to let our comrades fight alone?!

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:40.660
Mikasa!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.120
Let's do it!

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:43.750
Eren...

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:47.210
The last game, shoulder wars, will start soon.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:50.500
All students should head
to their designated area.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.340
I repeat. The last game,
shoulder wars, will start soon.

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:54.130
Hurry up, Mikasa!

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:57.300
All students should head
to their designated area.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.970
- Mikasa.
- Hm?

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:01.010
Got a minute?

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:04.640
Now, it's time for the last game, shoulder wars!

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:08.650
If you take your opponents' leaders' bandanas,
you may be able to turn the tables!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.860
Well then, ready...

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.570
Set...!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.370
Man, Mikasa's incredible...

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:24.700
How can she move so fast?!

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.290
Anyway, we'll make it a quick game!

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:29.500
Get to their leaders
before our bandanas are taken!

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.250
Yeah!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:31.710
Year 1, don't get cocky!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.380
Don't let Year 1—

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:36.960
Talking during shoulder wars is
a guaranteed way to bite your tongue.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:42.050
What?!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:44.810
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What?!

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.350
I-I told you that you
can't do all of those things!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.600
Petra! Sit up straight!

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:51.230
I got it!

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:55.730
I did it! I got Year 2 leader's bandana!

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:57.740
I did it, Mikasa!

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:59.360
Eren!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.080
Not bad, Year 1!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.700
Team Rico! Deal with the
Year 1 students in the rear!

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.250
Team Mitabi and my team will
take care of the two teams ahead!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:11.330
Roger!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:15.750
We'll use our full power and show them
how scary we upperclassmen really are.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.760
Eren, go on ahead! I'll hold them off!

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:20.340
Hey, Mikasa!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:24.100
Let's go, Eren! We have to do
what we can do now!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.220
Look this way, you brats!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:30.230
If you don't, I'll spank your
stinky butts with a baseball bat!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.770
Armin!

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.690
Go, Eren!

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.320
Fulfill your responsibility!

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:44.530
My eyes! My eyes!

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:45.990
My snack!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.750
Armin, help! Franz is... Franz is...

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.960
Don't look back!
We'll go for the Year 3 leader!

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:54.880
We're gonna break through!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:58.590
Huh?

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:01.470
Levi! Wh-What're you doing?!

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.510
As you can see...

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.720
...I'm cleaning, of course.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.310
You're in my way. Go away.

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:09.640
Don't back down, Eren!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:11.600
Now's our chance! Let's do it!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:16.770
You're right! Are we gonna give up
this chance that everyone sacrificed for

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:20.150
and meekly clean the Titans' building?!

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.200
No way!

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:26.120
We haven't really lost yet!

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.160
Let's go!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:28.790
Yeah!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:34.870
I'm gonna get the Year 3 leader's bandana!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:43.010
I just swept that area.
Watch where you're going!

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:45.090
Hey!

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.680
If we, Year 3, win, can I use this?

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.850
I can, right?! Can I?!

00:13:58.230 --> 00:13:59.650
Ugh!

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.620
<b>Attack Junior High Sports Day</b>

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:11.910
Geez...

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.290
That's too much... you damn four-eyes.

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.460
This is endless...

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.420
Hey, there aren't enough brooms.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:26.510
We should have enough for all of—

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.590
Upperclassmen... What're you doing here?

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:33.060
Well, there were times that
we defied our upperclassmen

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:35.140
because we got annoyed by their lectures.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.980
Then you guys have been there and...

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.400
That's right.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:43.990
Last year, Levi and the others won
by a huge margin, but they helped us.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.400
It'll be quicker if we divide the work.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.740
Now, move it!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:50.740
Let's finish it quickly!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:53.080
Upperclassmen...!

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:56.790
We're sorry that we talked impudently!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.920
Don't take it wrong, Year 1.
I'm doing it because it'd be upsetting

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.300
if you think I'm just someone with a big attitu—.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:07.470
Come to think of it,
where are Levi and the others?

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:09.590
I'm sorry, Levi!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.640
Hold it, you damn four-eyes!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:22.440
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>climb over that wall</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:28.200
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.700
<i>That enormous strength is precisely</i>
<i>what leads the way to freedom</i>

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:39.420
<i>Let's look beyond this conflict, Ausfall!</i>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:54.510
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:16:00.190
<i>we're stuck in restrictions and exploits</i>

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.730
<i>Even if our glory days of youth</i>
<i>get trampled upon,</i>

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:16.240
<i>I won't give in to that</i>
<i>absurd scolding voice, either</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>I pledged to the earth that I'd make</i>
<i>our dreams and hopes come true</i>

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.340
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>the blood in my veins calls forth the future</i>

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:33.140
<i>We'll pull apart all those troublesome rules</i>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.600
<i>Now's the time to raise the flag</i>
<i>of revolt upon that steep wall</i>

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Seek prosperity, Ausfall!</i>

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:50.490
At night, the screams of Eren
and the others echo through the school.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:56.030
The Scouts' customary test of courage
is held in a gloomy school building.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:56.990
The name of the man
who is the advisor to the event is...

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.990
Spine-chiller! Titan Junior High School
